/Title (The objective of page replacement algorithms is to minimize the page faults FIFO page replacement algorithm replaces the oldest page in the memory Optimal page replacement algorithm replaces the page which will be referred farthest in the future LRU page replacement algorithm replaces the page that has not been used for the longest duration of time LIFO page replacement algorithm replaces the newest page in memory Random page replacement algorithm replaces any page at random Optimal page replacement algorithm is considered to be the most effective algorithm but cannot be implemented in practical scenarios due to various limitations)
