496 0 obj
<<
/Title (Initially, since all the slots are empty, pages 3, 1, 2 cause a page fault and take the empty slots. Page faults = 3 When page 1 comes, it is in the memory and no page fault occurs. Page faults = 3 When page 6 comes, it is not in the memory, so a page fault occurs and the least recently used page 3 is removed. Page faults = 4 When page 5 comes, it again causes a page fault, and page 1 is removed as it is now the least recently used page. Page faults = 5 When page 1 comes again, it is not in the memory, and hence page 2 is removed according to the LRU. Page faults = 6)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 495 0 R
